  "description": "This receipt is a thermal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by SS Fried Chicken Lhokseumawe, located in Lhokseumawe, Aceh, Indonesia. The header displays the restaurant name, branch location, order type (TAKE-AWAY), queue number, transaction number, branch name, and the transaction open and close timestamps. The receipt includes an itemized order section with package selections and associated modifiers before concluding with a financial summary showing the Total and the QRIS BSI digital payment amount. The footer contains a customer appreciation message, the company's official website, WhatsApp contact number, Instagram account (@ssfriedchicken.id), and Facebook page (ssfriedchicken). This receipt represents a standard Indonesian quick-service restaurant POS receipt for takeaway orders, combining transaction metadata, digital payment confirmation, and business contact information in a compact thermal receipt format.",
